{"3803780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lost in the World of Succubi", "steam_appid": 3803780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803780/extras/b86f36a86e18d6d13f7ba83fd60c23e4.avif?t=1785810250\" width=780 height=76 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the protagonist awakens, he finds himself in the &quot;Succubus World&quot; — a realm inhabited by succubi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can he avoid their interference and safely escape back to his original world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803780/extras/0be53ab60f5881909d00800d7ba0208f.avif?t=1785810250\" width=781 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a side-scrolling RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players control the protagonist, exploring the labyrinth and defeating succubi in order to escape from the Succubus World.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ <strong>Simple &amp; Satisfying Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803780/extras/6fa338c658edba93b0147faa8268b645.avif?t=1785810250\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy intuitive, tactile controls.<br>That’s all you need:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Jump,&quot; &quot;Dodge,&quot; and &quot;Slash&quot;!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ <strong>Discover Treasures and Unlock New Areas</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803780/extras/4f0b5df8789cdca5c47afa6c923d7171.avif?t=1785810250\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This time, it's a 2D exploration action game—your classic Metroidvania.<br>Across the map, you’ll find various treasure items.<br>Obtain new weapons and gear, and head off to explore new areas!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ <strong>Designed for Easy Play!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803780/extras/23be2d64c22dcaefc423dc4ac5d193c4.avif?t=1785810250\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change difficulty anytime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast travel from anywhere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retry instantly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamepad supported</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key configuration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto text advance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable text speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skip event scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat button</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destination guidance display</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more...</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803780/extras/b86f36a86e18d6d13f7ba83fd60c23e4.avif?t=1785810250\" width=780 height=76 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the protagonist awakens, he finds himself in the &quot;Succubus World&quot; — a realm inhabited by succubi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can he avoid their interference and safely escape back to his original world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803780/extras/0be53ab60